Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:41.35,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Three years until the Great Invasion, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.07,0:00:44.87,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I never practiced seriously\Nwith a sword or magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:48.62,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So I'll need... Strength! Haste!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.07,0:00:52.09,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,My spells are more effective?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.73,0:00:54.30,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Has my magic power increased?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.62,0:01:11.80,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I have more magic power than I used to,\Nbut my body can't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.59,0:01:15.26,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Even with a suicide charge,\NI'm dead in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:17.87,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Wait. It's all pointless if I die anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:22.76,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get stronger so I can live\N happily and healthily into old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.76,0:01:25.02,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What's gotten into him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.02,0:01:26.94,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,He's been acting weird since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:32.55,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Just three days ago, he'd call it quits\Nafter fifty staring contests in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.55,0:01:34.78,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I won most of the time, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:38.41,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,I swear, you kids are always up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.41,0:01:40.39,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Miss Layla.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.39,0:01:42.02,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:44.67,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,Has my idiot son been providing for himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:46.68,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,He came to beg me for food every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.68,0:01:48.97,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Hey, don't tell her that first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.97,0:01:51.85,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,You can give me the full story later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.85,0:01:54.71,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,What kind of monster is he fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.94,0:01:57.63,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,He's acting like a completely \Ndifferent person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:01:59.34,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:04.96,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I know, right? Until the other day, \Nhe had the eyes of a dead fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:09.98,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,And said his dream was to screw \Naround with his inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.27,0:02:13.96,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,There's only one thing that would make \Na kid like him change overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.71,0:02:15.97,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.97,0:02:17.74,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,A-A woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:19.40,Main - Italics,THERON & LAYLA/ID,0,0,0,,Guess it wasn't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.40,0:02:21.57,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Damn him. He beat me to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:24.33,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,If that's how our likely suspect responds, \Nmaybe I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:26.86,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,My back is burning for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.41,0:02:29.82,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Is this also an effect of my\N increased magic power?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:31.35,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Yikes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:37.34,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Confess. Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:39.31,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.73,0:02:42.75,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb! Who are \Nyou messing around with?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:44.96,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:46.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:48.23,Main - Top,LIESE,0,0,0,,Who is it? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:49.81,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:54.82,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Who was it? Who?! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.67,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.67,0:03:02.24,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,To make up for it,\N I made an extra-nice lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:04.19,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Help yourself to this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:08.25,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Hey, whoa, this {\i1}is{\i0} pretty decadent!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:11.56,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Anyway, so you're back, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:13.38,Default,CERAIA,0,0,0,,Good to see you again, Layla.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:19.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Since my master's here now,\Nthere's something I'd like to ask all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:21.78,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,Why so formal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:29.27,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Who do you think could exert influence\Nand bend the ear of multiple nations?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.27,0:03:30.77,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What kind of question is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:32.78,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,Bend the ear of nations, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:34.89,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,A king or something, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.89,0:03:39.47,Default,CERAIA,0,0,0,,The highest-ranking priests of Earth \NMother Kairis have influence as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.47,0:03:40.78,Default,CERAIA,0,0,0,,There's also...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.80,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,Randolph the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:47.03,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,The one who defeated the demon king\N in the war three hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:51.76,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Yeah. Even elves and dwarves, \Nnot just humans, might listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.18,0:03:55.54,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,So kings, high priests, and heroes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:58.55,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Of those, the only one\NI could be in two years is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:00.50,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:05.85,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Which means I have no choice\N but to become a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.43,0:04:09.29,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,Something has to have happened, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:12.90,Default,CERAIA,0,0,0,,I don't see the problem. \NHe's thinking about the future now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:16.79,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,We should watch over him \Nwith care for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.79,0:04:18.52,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Not like we have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:22.02,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,What gives? My back is burning again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:58.54,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Knowing what's coming \Nis certainly an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:01.28,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I'm glad I have a good memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.39,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:08.75,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I've never been so grateful \Nmy mom's such a bookworm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:12.64,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Are you serious about trying to become a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:16.14,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Of course. As quickly as possible too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:19.94,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,But it's not like that's something\Nyou can just go out and do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:23.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I know. Got any good ideas for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:26.42,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,How about defeating the demon king?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:28.83,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,If I could do that, I wouldn't be stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:30.16,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:33.91,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What do you think a hero needs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.18,0:06:36.25,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Strength, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:40.14,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That's a given, but strength \Nalone is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:42.42,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Then what else does a hero need?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.75,0:06:46.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,First, I think they need money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:48.26,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Well, that's oddly blunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:52.88,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,A hero doesn't accept rewards \Nfor helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:56.06,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That said, traveling\N and adventuring cost money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:59.69,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Yeah, you can't do either\Nwithout funds to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:01.94,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Next, a hero needs connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:05.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Receiving special treatment\Nfrom the famous and influential
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.33,0:07:07.37,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,naturally increases your own renown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:10.66,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,This is starting to sound shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:13.53,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You can do most things \Nwith money and connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:15.58,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,But that's still not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:16.87,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What else do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:19.37,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,A hero also needs luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:20.91,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Luck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.91,0:07:24.26,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yes, but not just any kind of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.75,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Gotta be in the right place\Nwhen misfortune strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:30.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Then you step in and become a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.93,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:36.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No, I'm not talking about creating \Nproblems so I can solve them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:42.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,In any case, I intend to use all means \Navailable, even if they're underhanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:46.75,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound like something \Nan aspiring hero would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:50.28,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Why do you even want to be one, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:51.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.75,0:07:57.80,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,When I look at you, it doesn't feel\Nlike becoming a hero is your real goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:08:01.91,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,It's like that's a step on your way\N to achieving something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:08.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I do have my reasons, but you'll\N just have to trust me, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:13.38,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,If you say so, then fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:16.68,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Good luck. I'll be rooting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.07,0:08:20.94,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Actually, I expect you to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:26.69,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Now, I can use this for funds,\Nand I'd like to meet her again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:29.82,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,As for renown, if I can do something\Nabout the Archen incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:33.10,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I'll be cutting it close, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:35.53,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,Going on a journey, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.87,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,This is rather sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:41.16,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,Have you told Ceraia?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:43.88,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yes. She cried a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:45.91,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,Well, she's overprotective.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:47.60,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,What did you tell Lauer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:53.01,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,Well, learning more\N about the world is a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:55.54,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,Take this guy with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:56.30,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:59.64,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I intended to, but I'm glad \Nto have your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.52,Default,LAYLA,0,0,0,,He makes a good shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:04.96,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I wouldn't waste him like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.55,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I need a sacrificial pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:09.65,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Does what I want not matter? How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:14.15,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Is it true you're going on a journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:16.37,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah, in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:18.03,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:20.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,My first stop is Malad, the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:25.14,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll get what I need there,\Nand then the real work can begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:26.75,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Listen, Kyle...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.75,0:09:28.68,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm not taking you with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:31.80,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Why not? You're taking Theron, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.80,0:09:34.92,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I train with the Oracle Warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:37.05,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I won't get in your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:42.56,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I doubt your mother would want \Nyou to put yourself in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.46,0:09:46.62,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I'll apologize at her grave \Nas much as I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:50.02,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I want you to stay someplace safe too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.31,0:09:51.52,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,But I—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:07.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,When I return, you'll be\N the first person I come see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:10.29,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So have faith and wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:11.96,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:15.05,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I can't say anything when you pull that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:17.28,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Call it the composure that comes with age.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:20.35,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?\NWe're both sixteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:26.87,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll come back safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.87,0:10:29.15,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. I won't do anything reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:31.40,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.57,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you come shopping with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.57,0:10:45.76,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:47.51,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Oh, an elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:52.00,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,How unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:54.09,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,She's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.39,0:10:59.59,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:04.42,Flashback,URZA,0,0,0,,Kyle...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:08.02,Flashback,URZA,0,0,0,,When we're alone together, \Ncall me by my true name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:10.44,Flashback,URZA,0,0,0,,My true name is—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:11.94,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Eksess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:14.69,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:16.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:18.88,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Crap. We're just meeting for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:20.70,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Worse, that name is a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.70,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Just who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.32,0:11:25.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:28.20,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:30.42,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,She's going to make a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:31.60,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.93,0:11:33.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Sleep, Eksess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:36.76,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,H-How dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:45.14,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, she did mention\Nshe'd been to Rimarzé before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:47.64,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Never expected to run into her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:55.52,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Kyle, I know she's beautiful, but I can't \Nbelieve you'd make a move on her so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:11:58.52,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I-I can explain all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.52,0:12:00.55,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,See, I was lonely without you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:02.45,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:04.53,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,You have me right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:06.82,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going with you after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:10.36,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,And you can't stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:20.70,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Uh, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.70,0:12:23.68,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's Miss Urza, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.09,0:12:27.02,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You think that'll work now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:30.57,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Only my parents and I know my true name!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:32.23,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Where and how did you learn it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:35.39,Main - Top,KYLE,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:36.49,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I can't tell her that, four years from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.49,0:12:41.15,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,we'll fall in love and she'll \Nshare it with me herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:45.11,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Normally, I'd have to kill you\N to keep you silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.11,0:12:46.78,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,H-Hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.84,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll tell you eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:49.95,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.95,0:12:53.42,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Have you any idea how important \Nan elf's true name is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:57.44,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I do, but I can't let you kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:59.55,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So I have a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:02.87,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Until I can tell you, why don't \Nwe do an Application of the Contract
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.87,0:13:05.43,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,to prevent me from using\Nyour true name for evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:07.94,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You know about the\NApplication of the Contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:14.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Usually, contracts are forged with spirits,\Nbut in the name of deities,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:18.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,elementalers can give their \Ntrue name to bind human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:24.42,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The terms will be that I won't tell anyone \Nyour true name or use it for ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:25.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:28.26,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You know what happens\Nif you break the contract, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.22,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:35.08,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,My life is hanging in the balance as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:36.83,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,If you're serious, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.21,0:13:41.32,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:46.44,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,That said, I cannot currently forge\N the contract unless the moon is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:49.40,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,The next full moon is a few weeks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:52.42,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,We'll have to stay here in town until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:56.27,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. I'm actually leaving tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:13:59.16,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,C-Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:03.40,Default,CERAIA,0,0,0,,Kyle, you can't just eat meat, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:05.64,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I know, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.64,0:14:08.27,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.27,0:14:10.27,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're really coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.27,0:14:12.91,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Of course. That's already settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:17.79,Default,LAUER,0,0,0,,Good luck, Kyle. And make sure\N you watch out for your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.07,0:14:21.93,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,He's talking to you, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.93,0:14:23.04,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:25.55,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Even my dad's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.55,0:14:29.42,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Well, Mom, Dad... take care of yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.42,0:14:32.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Don't stay up all night reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:33.72,Default,CERAIA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:35.69,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.63,0:14:40.79,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,We'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:54.25,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'm delighted a beauty like you \Ndecided to join our party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:57.70,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I'm just here to watch him. \NI'm not part of your party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:15:00.96,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't the royal capital the other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:04.09,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We can save that for later
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:07.65,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,now that Urza the elementaler \Nhas joined our party.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:09.47,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I-I told you, I'm not in your party.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:16.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,First, we make for the Sungard Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:19.10,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Do you know the Legend of Sungard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.10,0:15:23.07,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Isn't that about the ancient \Nmagic kingdom of Xarles?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:26.54,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,It's about the Magic Queen's Labyrinth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:28.71,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,That place is just a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:29.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.32,0:15:32.29,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I have here a map of the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:34.62,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It even shows the treasure room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:35.64,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Kyle...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:39.41,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You poor thing. You got scammed with a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.41,0:15:41.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No! I swear it's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.63,0:15:44.05,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Right. Of course you want to believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:48.12,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,People who become obsessed \Nwith money always end up unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:52.26,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess it's too much \Nto expect them to buy in like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.21,0:15:54.26,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,This map...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:57.73,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,It's made from a magic tree \Nover a thousand years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:01.56,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,The technology has long been lost, \Nso these can no longer be produced.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:02.92,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,It's most likely genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.27,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:06.06,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Then it's gotta be the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.06,0:16:08.37,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You can always trust what\Na beautiful woman says.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.37,0:16:09.53,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,These jerks...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:11.91,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,But this place looks massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.91,0:16:14.78,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,How long will it take to reach the treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:17.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:19.91,Default,LIESE & THERON,0,0,0,,Which is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:22.16,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We'll dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:26.13,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Why are we digging a tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:29.09,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I told you, we're digging a \Nshortcut to the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:32.30,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The labyrinth is huge \Nand full of dangerous traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:33.48,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Traps?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:35.85,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,There are lots of riddles too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.11,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Riddles?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.11,0:16:39.58,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,There are even autonomous magic weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:41.52,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Magic weapons?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:43.86,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Was all that stuff on the map?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:45.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Uh, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:48.94,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I know they're there because of all\N the trouble they gave me last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:53.16,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,This labyrinth is the stuff of legend.\NWe have to be on our guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.16,0:16:55.52,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:57.58,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,When I swore to become a hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:17:00.44,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I didn't think digging a tunnel \Nwould be the first thing I'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:03.27,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I could say the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:06.63,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Why are we using a gnome spirit to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.12,0:17:11.71,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Hey, it's saving us the cost \Nof buying magic equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.99,0:17:16.43,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Theron, don't dig there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.43,0:17:18.22,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I haven't finished reinforcing the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:20.24,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:23.86,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,And Kyle, use Detect Magic to confirm \Nthe direction of the treasure room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:25.98,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm already on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:28.73,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or does Urza \Nseem the most into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:30.53,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Well, she's a serious girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:31.73,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,No chatting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.73,0:17:32.95,Default,KYLE & THERON,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.37,0:17:45.87,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,That's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.87,0:17:49.41,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Food tastes even better after hard labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:52.75,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,It's revitalizing after the effort \NI spent on spirit magic too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:55.13,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Have as much as you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:58.25,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Did you catch this, Liese?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:17:59.65,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.65,0:18:01.02,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,With a trap or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:02.17,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,My bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.17,0:18:03.01,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.79,0:18:10.81,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I never dreamed I'd get to take a \Nbath so deep in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:13.78,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,You made this, didn't you, Miss Urza?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:17.77,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Yes. I had an undine provide groundwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:21.28,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I devised this little trick for long journeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:24.94,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Magic is so nifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.94,0:18:27.92,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I'm jealous since I can't use any.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:31.17,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Felling a bear with your bare \Nhands is far more impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:35.17,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Did you get so strong for Kyle's sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:39.93,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I guess so, although I felt \NI needed it for myself too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:45.91,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Miss Urza, I don't think you need to worry\N about your true name too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.71,0:18:49.50,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I know Kyle's hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.93,0:18:54.44,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,But he'd never do anything to make us cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:19:01.20,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,So I plan to wait until he tells us what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.21,0:19:02.97,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.32,0:19:08.48,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,If he does anything to hurt you, \NMiss Urza, I'll take responsibility and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.80,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Call me Urza.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:10.75,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:13.21,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You don't need to call me "miss."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.78,0:19:15.69,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Okay, Urza.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.91,0:19:20.89,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,A heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:27.39,Main - Top,URZA,0,0,0,,Don't mention that!\NI'm self-conscious about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.86,0:19:30.19,Main - Top,LIESE,0,0,0,,You're so cute, Urza!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:32.73,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Let go of me! I'm gonna go spy on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.45,0:19:35.48,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Don't! I can't allow you to see them naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:40.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:43.62,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Theron's not back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:47.02,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Nah, he said he was taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:48.62,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He always does this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:51.47,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,No matter. I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:55.43,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Why do you want to become a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.21,0:20:01.76,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Liese and Theron won't pry because \Nthey trust you, but I'm different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:04.76,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Those rings are part of your \Ntraining, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.13,0:20:06.61,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:10.51,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Each one of these increases my \Nbody weight by two or three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.65,0:20:15.50,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,In any case, for now, I'm trying \Nto work on my physical fitness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:17.59,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Why go so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.16,0:20:21.15,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Does it have anything to do \Nwith you knowing my true name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.49,0:20:22.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:26.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.23,0:20:29.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Go fetch Liese and Theron!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.17,0:20:30.79,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,G-Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:40.53,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:41.83,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.83,0:20:42.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:43.97,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:48.47,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You could fool around for a lifetime \Nand still have money left over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.77,0:20:50.40,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:52.23,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Keep your wits about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:56.47,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We're only here because I need \Nmoney to achieve my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.81,0:20:59.48,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Don't become a slave to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:01.27,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Y-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.27,0:21:03.31,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,You're not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.31,0:21:06.86,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Look. That's what happens to people \Nwho become obsessed with money!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:09.37,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:11.45,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Money, money, money!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.45,0:21:14.87,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'm rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.12,0:21:17.45,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,How disgraceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:22.05,Main - Top,THERON,0,0,0,,I'm gonna spend this on so many women!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.45,0:21:19.38,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,No one wants to end up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:20.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Thank you, Theron.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:24.63,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Because of you, their hearts will remain pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:27.58,Main - Top,THERON,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Money, money, money!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.02,0:21:30.65,Main - Top,THERON,0,0,0,,It's all mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:30.65,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:21:59.93,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,A human, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:02.55,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you made it this far.
